  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Now using the formula&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>B</mi></math></p><p>We get,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, so option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is true.</p><p>Now solving option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,</p><p>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, so option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;is also true,</p><p>Now solving option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math>&nbsp;we get,&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8743;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>~</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8744;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8801;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>q</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8744;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>, so option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> is also correct.</p><p>Hence option&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;is only wrong.</p></blockquote>",
